      291.38
    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      302.47,
      455.88,
      351.86
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 47 of the Employees\u2019 Provident Fund Act,No. 15 of 1958 and the legal effect of the section as amended is to exempt an internationalworker from making any contribution under the aforesaid Act who is contributing to asocial security programme in his own country with which Sri Lanka has a social securityagreement, for the period as set out in such agreement.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
