      188.49,
      223.25,
      375.33,
      245.15
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE EMPLOYEES\u2019 PROVIDENT FUNDACT, NO. 15 OF 1958",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      255.05,
      401.91,
      276.95
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      286.85,
      401.88,
      329.99
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Employees\u2019 ProvidentFund (Amendment) Act, No. of 2021 and shall come intooperation on such date as the Minister may appoint by Orderpublished in the Gazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      339.77,
      401.88,
      361.79
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 47 of the Employees\u2019 Provident Fund Act,No. 15 of 1958 is hereby amended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      371.57,
      401.89,
      435.95
    ],
    "text": "(1)in the definition of \u201cemployee\u201d, by the substitutionfor the words \u201cat any particular time;\u201d of the words\u201cat any particular time, and does not include adetached worker for the period of time specified ina social security agreement applicable to suchdetached worker;\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      445.73,
      401.89,
      478.31
    ],
    "text": "(2)immediately after the definition of the expression\u201ccovered employment\u201d, by the insertion of thefollowing new definition:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      208.89,
      489.17,
      401.89,
      596.27
    ],
    "text": "\u201c \u201c detached worker\u201d means an internationalworker on a temporary assignment incovered employment in Sri Lanka andcontributing to a social securityprogramme in the country in which he is acitizen and who in terms of a socialsecurity agreement has been exemptedfrom making any contribution under thisAct for the period as set out in suchagreement;\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      606.17,
      401.9,
      628.07
    ],
    "text": "(3)immediately after the definition of \u201cemployer\u201d, bythe insertion of the following new definition:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      207.81,
      638.93,
      401.88,
      672.83
    ],
    "text": "\u201c \u201c international worker\u201d means, an employeewho is a citizen of a country other thanSri Lanka;\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
